neric client types and interfaces. Each \"copy\" commit is followed by the \"modify\" commit for that file. Reviewers can start from reviewing the \"modify\" commit.\r\n\r\nPS: Currently loadreport_test.go has compilation error as so its commented out as it is depends on some of the functions added in https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/8183\r\n\r\nRELEASE NOTES: None","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8250/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8250/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8310","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8310/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8310/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8310/events","html_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/8310","id":3056250921,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAacf886VzMT2","number":8310,"title":"xds: migrate internal xdsclient to use generic client and dedicated LRS client","user":{"login":"purnesh42H","id":12795451,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk1NDUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12795451?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H","html_url":"https://github.com/purnesh42H","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/user