/api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/milestones/67","html_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/milestone/67","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/milestones/67/labels","id":11736962,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAacf884AsxeC","number":67,"title":"1.69 Release","description":"","creator":{"login":"purnesh42H","id":12795451,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk1NDUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12795451?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H","html_url":"https://github.com/purnesh42H","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":108,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-10-16T04:39:09Z","updated_at":"2025-01-22T07:20:39Z","due_on":"2024-12-10T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2024-12-23T03:47:33Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2024-10-09T19:01:32Z","updated_at":"2025-04-16T02:02:07Z","closed_at":"2024-10-17T03:40:34Z","assignee":{"login":"purnesh42H","id":12795451,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk1NDUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12795451?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H","html_url":"https://github.com/purnesh42H","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":"resolved","draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/pulls/7717","html_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/7717","diff_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/7717.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/7717.patch","merged_at":"2024-10-17T03:40:34Z"},"body":"#a71-xds-fallback\r\n#xdsclient-refactor\r\n\r\nThe existing structure of the xDS client is as follows:\r\n- the xDS client has an `authority` type for each authority configuration in the bootstrap (ignoring authority sharing)\r\n- each `authority` has a `Transport` which contains a `grpc.ClientConn` to the xDS management server\r\n- the `Transport` type provides the following functionality\r\n  - runs an ADS stream, and allows the authority to trigger a `DiscoveryRequest` to be sent\r\n  - runs an LRS stream, and allows the authority to start the load reporting\r\n\r\nThe new structure for the xDS client will be as follows:\r\n- the xDS client will have one `authority` type for each authority configuration in the bootstrap (even if the authority configuration are the same or have the same server configuration)\r\n- the xDS client will own a bunch of `xdsChannel`s, one each for each server configuration specified in the bootstrap\r\n- each `authority` will acquire references to one of more `xdsChannel` instances\r\n- each `xdsChannel` will contain the following\r\n  - a `Transport` to the xDS management server. This will be an interface allowing for non-grpc transports to be used.\r\n  - an ADS stream instance that runs an ADS stream and supports resource subscription/unsubscription.\r\n  - an LRS stream instance that runs an LRS stream and support starting and stopping the stream.\r\n\r\nThis PR introduces the following functionality:\r\n- Defines the `Transport` interface and provides a gRPC transport implementation.\r\n- An LRS stream implementation.\r\n\r\nThe current LRS implementation can be found in https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/blob/master/xds/internal/xdsclient/transport/loadreport.go, and this PR's implementation is heavily based off of it.\r\n\r\nSubsequent PRs will add more functionatlity.\r\n\r\nAddresses https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/issues/6902\r\n\r\nRELEASE NOTES: none","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/7717/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/7717/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}